ao_audiounit: share the AVAudioSession between players

The session is process-wide; reference-count it so one player's uninit
does not deactivate it under another. Adds --audiounit-skip-session-management
for apps that manage the session themselves. Inherited from the fork,
ported to 0.41.0 (keeps 0.41's MixWithOthers / AO_INIT_EXCLUSIVE handling).

